## Core concept

Demo Mode lives inside the **existing Developer Mode area** — no new toggle screen, no manual trigger panel. When enabled, it is fully automatic from that point on: a timer selects readings and pushes them into `VitalsProvider`, exactly as the real BLE stream would. Nothing downstream (vitals ring, dashboard, `EmergencyProvider`, alert screens) should behave any differently than it would with real data — Demo Mode only changes the *source* of the reading, never how it's processed.

There is no manual button panel. Demo Mode is a single automated mode.

