## State machine note

Don't fork `EmergencyEvent`'s state machine. Add a lightweight distinction — an `EmergencyTrigger` enum (`suddenAbnormal` / `exerciseAbnormal`) or an `isExerciseContext` flag on the `DETECTED` state — so both tiers resolve through the same `DETECTED → RESOLVED/CANCELLED` machine, just with different countdown durations and different first-screen UI.

