## New/modified components

- `demo_readings.dart` — the fixed synthetic readings (constants, not manual-trigger buttons)
- `DemoModeEngine` — timer-driven service that selects readings, applies the cooldown, and pushes into `VitalsProvider`
- `HealthCheckScreen` — new screen for the Tier 2 60-second flow, visually distinct from `EmergencyCountdownScreen`
- `EmergencyProvider` — extend (not replace) to accept a trigger type/context flag and route to the correct first screen with the correct countdown duration
- A persistent **"DEMO MODE ACTIVE"** banner/badge shown anywhere simulated data is driving the UI

