## Edge cases to handle explicitly

- Demo Mode toggled off mid-countdown → cancel any active countdown/alert/timer cleanly, no orphaned state.
- App backgrounded during a Tier 2 Health Check countdown → resume-on-reopen logic (reuse the existing pattern from the main emergency countdown).
- Demo Mode's own timer must never fire a second abnormal reading while one is already active/pending or within cooldown — no stacked or queued alerts.

